// PC Interactions and Option Handling
#org @gText_GameModifiers_BootingUpPC
This terminal allows you to toggle\ngame modifiers which affect the\lway the game is played.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_ChooseAModifierPrompt
Please make a selection.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_LoggingOff
Logging off...

#org @gText_GameModifiers_ModifierNotYetAchieved
The conditions to unlock this\nmodifier have not been achieved.\pWould you like to enter a password\nto unlock it immediately?

#org @gText_GameModifiers_PasswordIncorrect
[RED]Password is incorrect.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_PasswordCorrect
[GREEN]Password is correct.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_TurnOffPrompt
This modifier is currently [GREEN]on[BLACK].\nDo you want to turn it off?

#org @gText_GameModifiers_TurnOnPrompt
This modifier is currently [GREEN]off[BLACK].\nDo you want to turn it on?

#org @gText_GameModifiers_ModifierNowOff
The modifier has been [GREEN]disabled[BLACK].

#org @gText_GameModifiers_ModifierNowOn
The modifier has been [GREEN]enabled[BLACK].


// Randomizer specific strings
#org @gText_GameModifiers_RandomizerSpecies_RandomizationQuestion
Do you want to randomize between the\nKulure Dex or Gens 1-8?

#org @gText_GameModifiers_RandomizerSpecies_Kulure
Kulure Pok\eDex

#org @gText_GameModifiers_RandomizerSpecies_AllGens
All Gens

#org @gText_GameModifiers_InstantBattleWeather_ChosenWeatherChoice
Which weather effect do you want\nactive in battle?

#org @gText_GameModifiers_InstantBattleWeather_Sun
Harsh Sunlight

#org @gText_GameModifiers_InstantBattleWeather_Rain
Rain

#org @gText_GameModifiers_InstantBattleWeather_Sandstorm
Sandstorm

#org @gText_GameModifiers_InstantBattleWeather_Hail
Hail

#org @gText_GameModifiers_InstantBattleWeather_Fog
Fog

#org @gText_GameModifiers_InstantBattleTerrain_ChosenTerrainChoice
Which terrain effect do you want\nactive in battle?

#org @gText_GameModifiers_Common_Cancel
Cancel

// Modifier Descriptions

#org @gText_GameModifiers_RandomizerSpecies_Description
When enabled, randomizes Pok\emon\nspecies.\pRandomization can be done against\nthe Kulure dex or gens 1-8.\p[RED]NOTE: Gens 1-8 randomizaiton is\nnot guaranteed to be stable!

#org @gText_GameModifiers_RandomizerMovesets_Description
When enabled, randomizes Pok\emon\nmovesets.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_RandomizerAbilities_Description
When enabled, randomizes abilities\nPok\emon can have.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_RandomizerCommon_Details
Note: Randomization is based on a\nseed assigned to your save file.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_InverseBattles_Description
When enabled, type effectiveness is\nreversed in battle.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_CamomonBattles_Description
When enabled, Pok\emon types are\ndecided by their first 2 moves.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_DoubleBattles_Description
When enabled, all battles are double\nbattles (whenever possible).

#org @gText_GameModifiers_GuaranteedCaptures_Description
When enabled, all Pok\e Balls\nguarantee a capture.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_CatchTrainerPokemon_Description
When enabled, the player can catch\na trainer's Pok\emon in battle.\pBattle ends once any Pok\emon is\ncaught and prize money is not\lawarded.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_ScaleWildPokemon_Description
When enabled, wild Pok\emon match the\nlowest level in the player's party.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_ScaleTrainerPokemon_Description
When enabled, trainer Pok\emon match\nthe highest level in the player's\lparty.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_HiddenAbilities_Description
When enabled, wild Pok\emon will\nalways have their hidden abilities\l(if they have one).

#org @gText_GameModifiers_Shinies_Description
When enabled, all wild Pok\emon will\nbe shiny.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_MoveReminderAllMoves_Description
When enabled, the Move Reminder will\nteach moves regardless of level.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_KeepHeldConsumables_Description
When enabled, held consumable items\nare returned after battle.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_DexNavShowAll_Description
When enabled, all searchable Pok\emon\nare shown in the DexNav, even if\lthey haven't been encountered yet.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_InstantBattleWeather_Description
When enabled, battles will start with\nthe preferred weather.\pThis is overridden by abilities and\nwill not influence evolutions.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_InstantBattleTerrain_Description
When enabled, battles will start with\nthe preferred terrain.\pThis is overridden by abilities.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_InstantFriendship_Description
When enabled, Pok\emon instantly\nreach max friendship.

