// Unlock Criteria

#org @gText_GameModifiers_UnlockCriteria_CompleteUltraSpaceEpisode
[BLUE]Unlock Criteria: [BLACK]Complete the\npostgame Ultra episode.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_UnlockCriteria_AllTrainerHouses
[BLUE]Unlock Criteria: [BLACK]Complete all Trainer\nHouses and become Champion.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_UnlockCriteria_CompleteThePokedex
[BLUE]Unlock Criteria: [BLACK]Catch all\nPok\emon in the game.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_UnlockCriteria_DefeatKurtis
[BLUE]Unlock Criteria: [BLACK]Defeat a vengeful\ntrainer in the postgame.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_UnlockCriteria_CatchAllLegendaries
[BLUE]Unlock Criteria: [BLACK]Catch all legendary\nand mythical Pok\emon in Kulure.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_UnlockCriteria_ChampionDefense
[BLUE]Unlock Criteria: [BLACK]Defend your Champion\ntitle 3 or more times.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_UnlockCriteria_GymLeaderRematches
[BLUE]Unlock Criteria: [BLACK]Complete all gym\nleader rematches in a single day.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_UnlockCriteria_LevelOneHundred
[BLUE]Unlock Criteria: [BLACK]Have a level 100\nPok\emon in the party when accessing\lthis PC.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_UnlockCriteria_AllTMsAndHMs
[BLUE]Unlock Criteria: [BLACK]Acquire all 100 TMs\nand all 6 HMs in Kulure.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_UnlockCriteria_3OrMoreLevel25DexNavSearches
[BLUE]Unlock Criteria: [BLACK]Reach DexNav Search\nLevel 25 with at least 3 Pok\emon\land become the Champion.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_UnlockCriteria_BattleBondGreninja
[BLUE]Unlock Criteria: [BLACK]Obtain an\nunbreakable bond with a Greninja.

#org @gText_GameModifiers_UnlockCriteria_AllUteyanRuinPuzzles
[BLUE]Unlock Criteria: [BLACK]Solve the mysteries\nof the Uteyan Ruins and become\lChampion.

